    "title": "A true story of survival and tragedy discussed at The Bookworm of Edwards - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tricia Swenson ,\n8 hours ago The lure of the mountain peaks, weightless powder turns and the solitude of the backcountry draw many, but the rewards of thrill and adventure also come with huge risks. Those risks and rewards are measured in a new book that will be featured at The Bookworm of Edwards this Thursday. “The Way Out: A True Story of Survival in the Heart of the Rockies” by Devon O’Neil will take you through the heartbreak, blame, resilience and challenges that shook up a small town in Colorado. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
